# Wave W17-X (Route 210 — North): fog turf — fog-meadow turf, pale murk flecks: a desaturated grey-green meadow carrying pale murk flecks, the talking grass of the story line gone quiet-toned under permanent fog (design: fog banks rolling between frosted trees; in fog, walk by ear). Route 210 — North’s own ground — split from Route 210’s clear deep pasture south of it by the murk entire: same valley, weather closed over it.
